<title>THAILAND: Bank of Thailand says baht reference rate 29.155.</title>
<headline>Bank of Thailand says baht reference rate 29.155.</headline>
<dateline>BANGKOK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Thailand on Friday announced that the weighted average interbank exchange rate was 29.155 per dollar against 29.075 on Thursday.</p>
<p>The reference rate is the average rate traded the previous day. It has been announced daily by the central bank since last week's managed flotation of the baht.</p>
<p>The baht was quoted at 29.40/29.50 onshore and 29.35/29.45 in offshore markets in early trade.</p>
<p>-- Bangkok newsroom (662) 652-0642</p>
